{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drowning in debt and trapped in the grind of 1990s corporate Japan, Issei Ito is offered a way out: by selling out the company that signs his paycheck. As a security specialist at METTA East, you'll balance a double life\u2014juggling office politics by day and corporate espionage by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack servers to steal information, manipulate rivals, &amp; climb the corporate ladder. Navigate a branching story of loyalty, betrayal, and moral compromise, where your actions shape the fate of your allies and rivals. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese Hacker Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To pay off your debt, you'll be expected to infiltrate secure servers in a strategic, node-based hacking mini-game.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/demonstration.gif?t=1753152289\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll continually sharpen your hacking ability by unlocking new towers and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/hackingMenu.gif?t=1753152289\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese</strong>\u00a0<strong>Worker Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you still need to do your day job to keep your secret safe and upper management happy. Of course, answering emails is a staple of office life. Make sure you keep things professional, of course, we wouldn't want to irritate anyone. But... then again, picking favorites could have some benefits.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese</strong>\u00a0<strong>Hustle\u00a0Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Despite your espionage, you're still broke and have to find \u201calternate\u201d ways to make ends meet. You'll have to work as anything and everything from a barista to a garbage man.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/dd47925f709b3a5a0beed6b6b33de5c4.avif?t=1753152289\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3098910?t=1753152289","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/7ff3e29faa78e6bb236939c167f2f208cd8b7e94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753152289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/768be44564d271cea9526c73f96771e6bf9274bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753152289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/768be44564d271cea9526c73f96771e6bf9274bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753152289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drowning in debt and trapped in the grind of 1990s corporate Japan, Issei Ito is offered a way out: by selling out the company that signs his paycheck. As a security specialist at METTA East, you'll balance a double life\u2014juggling office politics by day and corporate espionage by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack servers to steal information, manipulate rivals, &amp; climb the corporate ladder. Navigate a branching story of loyalty, betrayal, and moral compromise, where your actions shape the fate of your allies and rivals. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese Hacker Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To pay off your debt, you'll be expected to infiltrate secure servers in a strategic, node-based hacking mini-game.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/demonstration.gif?t=1753152289\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll continually sharpen your hacking ability by unlocking new towers and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/hackingMenu.gif?t=1753152289\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese</strong>\u00a0<strong>Worker Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you still need to do your day job to keep your secret safe and upper management happy. Of course, answering emails is a staple of office life. Make sure you keep things professional, of course, we wouldn't want to irritate anyone. But... then again, picking favorites could have some benefits.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese</strong>\u00a0<strong>Hustle\u00a0Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Despite your espionage, you're still broke and have to find \u201calternate\u201d ways to make ends meet. You'll have to work as anything and everything from a barista to a garbage man.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/dd47925f709b3a5a0beed6b6b33de5c4.avif?t=1753152289\" /></div></p>","developers":["Antikat","cNel"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/7688d77176157867b2268ed20da27acd7862e253/header.jpg?t=1753152289","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257165127,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165127/movie480.mp4?t=1751595264","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstat